---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
import { url } from '../lib-url';
---
<Base title="About">
  <section class="max-w-2xl pt-14">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-text">About</h1>
    <div class="prose mt-6">
      <p>I'm Furqan, a third-year CS student at FAST NUCES in Karachi. I want to work on systems, and I care about security as part of how a system is built. Breaking into other people's stuff interests me less.</p>
      <p>Most of my code is in C and C++, with some Python. Go is next on my list. I take on hard projects on purpose, because that's how I get better, and I say so on the pages when something isn't finished or I don't know yet.</p>
      <p>I'm looking for a remote internship in backend, systems or infrastructure.</p>
      <h2>What I've used, and where</h2>
      <p>This is organised by the projects I used each thing in. I didn't rate myself.</p>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Used in</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>C, C++, Linux internals</td><td><a href={url('/projects/aegis/')}>Aegis</a>, <a href={url('/projects/sam/')}>SAM</a> (<code>/proc</code>, Unix sockets); <a href={url('/projects/justiceflow/')}>JusticeFlow</a> (daemon, signals, shared memory)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Python</td><td><a href={url('/projects/lifeline/')}>Lifeline</a>, <a href={url('/projects/sysmon/')}>SysMon</a>, JusticeFlow dashboard and agents</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Security</td><td>Lifeline (Ed25519, X25519, ChaCha20-Poly1305); JusticeFlow (audit triggers, least-privilege database roles)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Databases</td><td>PostgreSQL in JusticeFlow; SQLite in SysMon</td></tr>
          <tr><td>In progress</td><td>C++20 core in <a href={url('/projects/nexus/')}>Nexus</a> (built and tested). Go: only a gateway skeleton so far, nothing shipped yet</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> · <a href={site.github}>github.com/Furqan-2006</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
